OL,3,GNEWSAFuture of hostel secured after    
OL,4,ANational Trust deal                    
OL,6,FThe future of a hostel in the Surrey   
OL,7,FHills has been secured after a lease   
OL,8,Fwas agreed between a group of          
OL,9,Fvolunteers and the National Trust.     
OL,11,FTanners Hatch, which sits on the       
OL,12,FPolesden Lacey Estate in the Surrey    
OL,13,FHills, was operated by the Youth Hostel
OL,14,FAssociation for 79 years until its     
OL,15,Fclosure in 2025.                       
OL,17,FThe volunteers, many of whom first met 
OL,18,Fwhile staying at the hostel in the     
OL,19,F1970s, have formed a community interest
OL,20,Fcompany (CIC) and intend to run Tanners
OL,21,FHatch on an independent basis from     
OL,22,Fearly next year.                       
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
