OL,3,GNEWSAFuture of hostel secured after    
OL,4,ANational Trust deal                    
OL,6,FChair the CIC, Nicole Lazarus, said:   
OL,7,F"We are thrilled to be able to ensure  
OL,8,Fthat this very special place will still
OL,9,Fbe here for people to escape the rat   
OL,10,Frace for a while."                     
